# terraform/terraform.tfvars.example
# ==============================================================
# EXAMPLE values – copy this file to terraform.tfvars and fill
# in your real values. terraform.tfvars is git-ignored and must
# NEVER be committed to version control.
# ==============================================================

aws_region       = "us-east-1"
app_name         = "ai-recipe-generator"
environment      = "production"
instance_type    = "t3.micro"       # or t3.small, t3.medium for more traffic
key_pair_name    = "my-ec2-keypair" # name of your key pair in AWS Console
ssh_allowed_cidr = "YOUR_IP/32"     # e.g. "203.0.113.42/32" – replace with your IP!
